# The published list of the JVM types a data family's values are held as
# (gezi.standardlibrary.JvmTypeName): generic, the framework's generic
# constructed value; list, the framework's list codec's lists.
# A Scott sum whose constructors are the tuple's fields, in the order of the
# enum's cases; the order is read by position and must match
# JvmTypeName.values. A knowledge file imports this file and writes a
# constructor as the second field of a member of its slot jvm_types, and
# KnowledgeFileReading reads which alternative it takes by structure, never
# by a name.
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λgeneric list. generic)
λ generic
. (λtuple. tuple λgeneric list. list)
λ list
. export generic list
